## UI Anti-Patterns to Avoid

| ❌ Don't                              | ✅ Do Instead                              |
|---------------------------------------|--------------------------------------------|
| Pure rectangular cards                | Large rounded corners (24px+)              |
| White or light backgrounds            | Dark backgrounds (0xFF0D0D0D–0xFF1A1A1A)   |
| System fonts (Roboto, San Francisco)  | Custom fonts (Playfair, Plus Jakarta Sans) |
| Hard drop shadows                     | Soft ambient glows                         |
| Static layouts                        | Subtle animations on interactions          |
| Over-animation / flashy effects       | Refined, purposeful micro-interactions     |
| Pure black (#000000)                  | Near-black with warmth (0xFF0D0D0D)        |
| Amber/Gold accent colors              | Red accent palette                         |
| Small corner radii (8-12px)           | Large corner radii (24px+)                 |

---

## Testing Checklist

After any UI changes:

1. ☐ Verify dark mode only (no light theme leakage)
2. ☐ Check text contrast (WCAG AA: 4.5:1 for normal, 3:1 for large)
3. ☐ Test scroll performance (target: 60fps)
4. ☐ Verify active happy hour states are immediately visible
5. ☐ Test on different screen sizes (phone, tablet)
6. ☐ Confirm no amber/gold colors remain
7. ☐ Test with reduce-motion enabled (animations disabled)
8. ☐ Verify const constructors used where possible
9. ☐ Check that no expensive operations in build() methods

